    "background": {
      "index": "guild-artisan",
      "name": "Guild Artisan",
      "description": "You are a member of an artisan's guild, skilled in a particular field and closely associated with other artisans. You are a well-established part of the mercantile world, freed by talent and wealth from the constraints of a feudal social order. You learned your skills as an apprentice to a master artificer, assisting with your master's work until you mastered the basics of your craft and were admitted to the guild as a master in your own right.",
